OL,3,GNEWSAMajor A52 delays after empty lorry
OL,4,Afound ablaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are being advised to expect
OL,7,Fmajor delays after a lorry fire led to
OL,8,Fclosures on a key road in
OL,9,FNottinghamshire.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid it was called to the fire at
OL,13,FSaxondale Island on the A52 on
OL,14,FWednesday morning. The fire has since
OL,15,Fbeen put out, but road closures are
OL,16,Fexpected to remain in place for "some
OL,17,Ftime".
OL,19,FNottinghamshire Police said the empty
OL,20,Florry was found ablaze at the side of
OL,21,Fthe road, at about 09:55 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
